  "project_description": "Back to top \n\n INTRODUCTION \n Acquia Cloud helper for the platform backup management.\n\nIf you are using Acquia ACSF watch the module acsf_backup_manager \n\n \n This module allows to set a time limit to keep your manual (on-demand) backups on Acquia Cloud, deleting by cron the older ones. \n \n Based on the API documentation on Acquia Cloud API Documentation \n\n Back to top \n\n REQUIREMENTS \n This module requires the Acquia Cloud API access, you should generate an API key.\n\n Read the Acquia documentation to generate it \n\n Also it requires the API library acquia-php-sdk-v2 on version 2.\n\n Back to top \n\n INSTALLATION \n Install as you would normally install a contributed Drupal module.\n\n Back to top \n\n CONFIGURATION \n It has a configuration page in \"Configuration / Web Services / Acquia Cloud - Backup Manager Settings\"\n\n Back to top",
